        {
            "id": "https://words.skylarkfoundry.com/erecting-cathedrals.html",
            "url": "https://words.skylarkfoundry.com/erecting-cathedrals.html",
            "title": "Erecting Cathedrals",
            "summary": "In sweat and blood they birthed the stones. Their backs bent in&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"align-center\">In sweat and blood they birthed the stones.<br>Their backs bent in a dimly lit choreography,  <br>they strained to hoist the ashlars into place.<br>Thirty-six years in a most sacred guild,<br>they each apprenticed the other.</div>\n<div class=\"align-center\"> </div>\n<div class=\"align-center\">Their aging bodies lust for sleep,<br>but it runs from them into the cold night.<br>Lying there, limbs entwined for warmth,<br>their calloused fingers touch scars,<br>which mark passing time on their rounding frames.</div>\n<div class=\"align-center\"> </div>\n<div class=\"align-center\">They remember the works of their labors.<br>The six structures on which they’ve toiled.<br>Their six children raised with hope.<br>The six cathedrals in whom they pray,<br>both their memories and Christ will dwell.</div>\n<div> </div>",
            "image": "https://words.skylarkfoundry.com/media/posts/28/images-5.jpeg",
            "author": {
                "name": "Kevin Kwilinski"
            },
            "tags": [
            ],
            "date_published": "2026-10-04T17:48:00-04:00",
            "date_modified": "2026-10-04T18:24:11-04:00"
        },
        {
            "id": "https://words.skylarkfoundry.com/maternal-silence.html",
            "url": "https://words.skylarkfoundry.com/maternal-silence.html",
            "title": "Maternal Silence",
            "summary": "She was a young woman, from a world of chaos. But She&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"align-center\">She was a young woman,<br>from a world of<br>chaos.</div>\n<div class=\"align-center\"> </div>\n<div class=\"align-center\">But She tried to hide<br>that chaos behind her<br>smile.</div>\n<div class=\"align-center\"> </div>\n<div class=\"align-center\">At first she would hear<br>me crying in the<br>crib.</div>\n<div class=\"align-center\"> </div>\n<div class=\"align-center\">But by the time I talked,<br>her world was<br>silent.</div>\n<div class=\"align-center\"> </div>\n<div class=\"align-center\">She would watch my lips<br>while I said my<br>prayers.</div>\n<div class=\"align-center\"> </div>\n<div class=\"align-center\">But sometimes I would peek<br>at her with one<br>eye.</div>\n<div class=\"align-center\"> </div>\n<div class=\"align-center\">Records played in her head,<br>which only she could<br>hear.</div>\n<div class=\"align-center\"> </div>\n<div class=\"align-center\">But we would often<br>dance to their<br>beat.</div>\n<div class=\"align-center\"> </div>\n<div class=\"align-center\">She taught me old lyrics,<br>which we sang<br>off-key.</div>\n<div class=\"align-center\"> </div>\n<div class=\"align-center\">But those melodies<br>are still my<br>favorite.</div>",
            "image": "https://words.skylarkfoundry.com/media/posts/27/scan0050-1.jpeg",
            "author": {
                "name": "Kevin Kwilinski"
            },
            "tags": [
            ],
            "date_published": "2026-10-04T17:38:23-04:00",
            "date_modified": "2026-10-04T17:38:23-04:00"
        },
        {
            "id": "https://words.skylarkfoundry.com/our-funeral.html",
            "url": "https://words.skylarkfoundry.com/our-funeral.html",
            "title": "Our Funeral",
            "summary": "We bury today our Alleluia. It is not dead, but on deposit,&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p class=\"align-center\">We bury today our Alleluia.<br>It is not dead,<br>but on deposit,<br>as our brother<br>who sleeps.</p>\n<p class=\"align-center\">But we who amble on,<br>don this burlap<br>and turn our<br>face to ash,<br>in penance.</p>\n<p class=\"align-center\"><br>This Lent more somber<br>as bombs fall,<br>as children flee,<br>while we wait<br>His return.</p>",
            "image": "https://words.skylarkfoundry.com/media/posts/26/images-4.jpeg",
            "author": {
                "name": "Kevin Kwilinski"
            },
            "tags": [
            ],
            "date_published": "2026-10-04T17:27:26-04:00",
            "date_modified": "2026-10-04T18:25:44-04:00"
        },
        {
            "id": "https://words.skylarkfoundry.com/prosperity-haiku.html",
