            "date_modified": "2026-10-04T17:19:04-04:00"
        },
        {
            "id": "https://words.skylarkfoundry.com/liquor.html",
            "url": "https://words.skylarkfoundry.com/liquor.html",
            "title": "Liquor",
            "summary": "The poetic word is potent. Like one hundred and seven proof bourbon,&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"align-center\">The poetic word is potent.<br>Like one hundred and seven proof<br>bourbon,<br>it makes me drunk.</div>\n<div class=\"align-center\"><br>Plenty of pages of prose<br>are distilled in<br>a single<br>verse.</div>\n<div class=\"align-center\"><br>It is irresistible as<br>I swirl it in my mouth.<br>Sniff it.<br>Taste it.</div>\n<div class=\"align-center\"><br>I breathe it in.</div>\n<div class=\"align-center\"><br>I hold it up to the light<br>to peer into its soul.</div>\n<div class=\"align-center\"><br>With voracious appetite,<br>I invert its glass until</div>\n<div class=\"align-center\"><br>the</div>\n<div class=\"align-center\"><br>last</div>\n<div class=\"align-center\"><br>drip</div>\n<div class=\"align-center\"><br>slides</div>\n<div class=\"align-center\">so<br>slowly</div>\n<div class=\"align-center\"><br>onto my </div>\n<div class=\"align-center\">silver<br>tongue.</div>",
            "image": "https://words.skylarkfoundry.com/media/posts/20/sippytitle-1.jpg",
            "author": {
                "name": "Kevin Kwilinski"
            },
            "tags": [
            ],
            "date_published": "2026-09-28T20:47:10-04:00",
            "date_modified": "2026-10-04T17:17:16-04:00"
